==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[High Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the first Gabriel with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], then start stacking Nyanko Rangers on Malizabeth. Once Lady Great Skory makes her appearance, don't bother sending out any more non-Wave Immune cat, as they won't be capable of even reaching her. Instead, use [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] as a tank while [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]], [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] to kill the supporting threats. If you're lucky, you'll be able to Freeze-lock High Countess Koryessa, but don't count on it until at least the initial wave of peons has been culled.

